# reference material, not part of this project, never meant to be
# distributed. Re-added 2026-08-17: the original 2026-08-16 removal commit
# stopped tracking the 3 gitlink entries but this line itself silently
# didn't survive that commit (the .gitignore file got saved with an
# encoding issue that day -- git logged it as a binary diff). Verified this
# time with `git check-ignore -v external_repos/IKEA` before trusting it.
external_repos/
omer-extended/

