# only. Not a credential/secret leak, just not meant for the public repo --
# see git log for the removal commit if this ever needs revisiting.
CLAUDE.md

# Per-attack live-verification incident logs (added 2026-08-16) --
# "we found bug X during a live run, here's the root cause" narratives,
# split out of the public aginiti/attacks/*/README.md files so those stay
# clean user-facing reference docs. The READMEs keep a distilled,
# actionable takeaway from each of these; this is the full story, for this
# project's own maintainers only.
aginiti/attacks/dra/verification-log.md
aginiti/attacks/mia/verification-log.md
aginiti/attacks/spe/verification-log.md
# --- Merged from Aginiti-Extended-by-Omer (feature/unified-redteam merge, 2026-08-19) ---
# NOTE: his gitignore also had a blanket `benchmarks/` entry -- deliberately
# NOT carried over. On his branch that ignored a vendored READ-ONLY copy of
# this repo's own benchmarks/ tree; in the unified repo benchmarks/ is real,
# tracked source (see the granular benchmarks/* rules above), and a blanket
# ignore here would silently untrack it.
*.log
runs/
targets/       # vendored third-party target apps (AnythingLLM, DVAA, DVLA, MCP fs server) -- test AGAINST, not part of this repo's own source
infra/         # operational scripts/logs/scratch, not version-controlled
archive/
